title: XenServer / XCP-ng: Pool
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors a XenServer or XCP-ng pool via the XAPI management API.
 Data is collected by the special agent {agent_xenserver}.

 The service shows the pool coordinator and all pool members. It goes {CRIT}
 if a host is not live, {WARN} (configurable) if a host is disabled
 (maintenance mode), if no performance data (RRD) could be read from a host,
 if HA is overcommitted, or if the configured address was not reachable and
 a failover address had to be used. The number of running VMs is graphed.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer Pool} is created on the host the special agent is configured for.
